ucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sQR0MMUWx2oQ7kNvwHfhWvS&_nc_oc=Adq8-wvw8DDZ4LaBk7EYzkGoHcUAnG-VFerZvUN1D8k_X15fVyHgwPD7GpDiZhCR81k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSTGe-SV58pYghrZ566EfKhtqANkfB3CI76AfwSpObyaA&oe=6B0B1ADA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Simple File Share", "keywords": ["filetransfer", "localfilesharing", "FTPserver", "WebDAVserver", "offlinefileshare"], "long_description": "# Simple File Share for Quest  \n**Wireless File Transfer via FTP & WebDAV \u2013 No Cables Needed!**  \n\nTired of using USB cables to transfer files? **Simple File Share** lets you wirelessly access and manage your Quest files using **FTP** or **WebDAV**\u2014no extra apps needed on your PC or phone!  \n\n## \ud83d\udd39 Key Features  \n\u2705 **Dual Protocol Support** \u2013 Choose between **FTP** (for broad compatibility) or **WebDAV** (for better security & performance)  \n\u2705 **No Extra Apps Needed** \u2013 Connect using any FTP client (FileZilla, WinSCP) or WebDAV browser (Windows Explorer, macOS Finder)  \n\u2705 **Secure Access** \u2013 Password-protected to keep your files private  \n\u2705 **Full Storage Control** \u2013 Upload, download, rename, and organize files effortlessly  \n\u2705 **Works Offline** \u2013 No internet required; operates entirely on your local WiFi network  \n\n## \u26a1 How It Works  \n1. **Launch Simple File Share** on your Quest  \n2. **Start the Server** (FTP or WebDAV)  \n3. **Connect from Any Device** (PC, phone, tablet) using the provided address  \n4. **Log In & Transfer Files** \u2013 No cables, no hassle!  \n\n## \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Privacy & Security  \n\ud83d\udd12 **Local Network Only** \u2013 No cloud uploads, no internet exposure  \n\ud83d\uded1 **Runs Only When Active** \u2013 No background processes when closed  \n\ud83d\ude80 **Fast & Lightweight** \u2013 No bloated software\u2014just simple, efficient transfers  \n\n## \ud83d\udccc Why Choose Simple File Share?  \n\u2714 **More Flexible** than HTTP-only solutions (supports FTP & WebDAV)  \n\u2714 **More Secure** than ad-hoc wireless transfer apps  \n\u2714 **Works ", "short_description": "Transfer files instantly between devices over FTP or WebDAV\u2014no internet or cable needed. Share photos, videos, and documents on same network."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://doc-hosting.flycricket.io/simple-file-share-privacy-policy/90c7b80b-690b-4063-b31f-ecfdeead22b2/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Kalki Arts", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://kalkiarts.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}, {"id": "1055187466124150"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25238891342367211"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 15, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2568388113628531"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1306298338087795"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1077490767965694"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2797618130621021"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "830790349824207"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2490932404658590"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3835739710067392"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1405795884177387"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "25991991000394740"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1686739038953512